{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_03_end","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_03","title":"圈套","storyCode":"CV-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"09f132822d6c5fa8e55a80ec87c1da3517e7f41c12b1f04392e272727dcb3c8b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说服里昂卖他自己的股份？不可能，我不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？你们不是朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和那小子之所以能做朋友，就是因为我从来不逼他做事。矿厂股份的事我们每个人都和他说过，但他谁的话也不听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我本来还想着，如果您愿意帮我劝劝里昂先生......就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就、就用这盒巧克力作为答谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，巧克力啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出发时家里的甜品师塞给我的，说是路上嘴巴空可以嚼一块，吃到现在就剩最后一盒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，这个，还真、真的有些舍不得送人。所以，既然伍德洛先生您不愿意，那只好算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）怎么只是“哦”了一声，这和说的不一样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您要是不愿意，就、就没有巧克力了，呃，不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我承认，是海伦娜女士建议我带巧克力来找您的......她说您喜欢这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她让你来，你就来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生的情况真的不容乐观......无论什么办法，我都要试一试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伍德洛直直地盯着杰西卡看，而杰西卡并未注意到。\n她沉浸在尴尬和挫败中，垂着头，绞尽脑汁地想着，如何让这次对话结束得快一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打扰了，我再回去想想别的办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那盒巧克力你放在柜子上就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去收拾下，洗把脸，一会儿就出发吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了？！我明明都露馅了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他到底看的是海伦娜女士的面子......还是这盒巧克力，算了，反正他都答应了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在柜子上......应该是这个柜子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抽屉是拉开的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老年萨科塔抽屉里的东西和他本人一样，简单质朴，不加一点修饰。\n一条腰带，一副铳械皮套，一双露指手套。\n放下巧克力，杰西卡注意到还有几张纸片被压在了手套下面。\n在岁月的侵蚀下，纸页呈现出一种发脆的黄色。\n杰西卡知道自己应该赶快撇开目光，但她的视线却不受控制地落在了上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......是伍德洛先生和老板的照片？还有另外一个萨科塔......照片底下有张纸......"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一份身份证明，黑色的字迹在褐色的纸张上并不清晰，只能依稀辨认出其中几个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯略斯......营地......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"巧克力还没有放好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好、好了，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就赶快走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生，现在您的财务状况岌岌可危，迟迟不做决定的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等银行宣布您无力偿还债务，您就只有破产一条路，到时无论是股份还是住房都保不住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您非要保留股份的话，就只能卖掉您现在居住的房子，可那样您会无家可归的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多劝我卖股份的人里，你是第一个让我卖房子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是让您卖房子，只是说这是可能的后果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不介意，我也可以......我是说，虽然这笔债务数目不小，但是我这里有些钱，可以给您的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！谢谢了，我不需要你的施舍，杰西卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不！我是说借给您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不收利息，也、也不用着急还，等您的经济情况好转后，再......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡小姐，我是个有手有脚的成年人，不用一个没我岁数一半大的小姑娘教我怎么改善生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望下次见你的时候，你已经把这事忘得干干净净了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......里昂先生，您、您不要推我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛，你还有闲心吹茶？那茶早凉了，赶快把这女孩带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生，你也说句话啊！你之前不是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说会和你一起来，然后我和你一起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你的巧克力，杰西卡，现在我得离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果里昂先生再这么拖下去，他什么都剩不下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何呢，费劲去烧一块湿透了的炭，到头来你只会碰一鼻子灰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生！你......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我们真的还有必要继续核查下去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走访几家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十四家。除了第二户那位中年人的儿子确实跟地块外的匪徒跑了之外，全是些还不上债的老实人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"银行一时抓不到他们的软肋，就想借我们的手把人赶走......卑鄙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经到第十五家门口了，最后再核查一家——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这是怎么了？你们怎么坐在室外？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头晕的老先生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晕......头晕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老太太","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，老头子，吹吹风，吹吹冷风就不晕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是中毒了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老太太","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还好我们发现得及时，两个人都没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，地块上的供暖......应该还保有最基本的功能才对，为什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老太太","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"银行宣布我们破产之后，就把我们这一片的供暖整个关掉了，屋子里不见阳光，比外面还要冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潦倒的老太太","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不然......谁愿意烧火盆呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......咳咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了，本尼。你蹲在炉子前做什么？快站起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天炉子里面湿得厉害，我点了好久，炭都没有烧起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你这一脸灰，简直像刚从矿里出来......快擦擦，点不起来就点不起来，等我回来再弄也行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸，不会是你早上出门着急，直接把水泼进炉子了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说，我再糊涂能糊涂到那个份上？把火钳给我，我去弄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说你不糊涂，怎么还直接用嘴吹的。卡尔说过，烧炉子这事你做不来，他离开前就全托付给我了，你什么时候管过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔跟你说过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全说啦，说你心急，为了熄火直接把一盆水倒进燃烧的烤炉里，不光炭坏了，海伦娜烤的面包也吃不成了，气得她臭骂了你一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔怎么什么都和你说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁让当时我不在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，怎么不在，你那时候太小啦，什么都不记得，坐在伍德洛怀里光顾着揪他胡子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我才不信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！谁啊......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，是我——咳，好呛的烟味儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炉子里面湿得厉害，我点了好久炭都烧不起来，你先在外面等一会儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。我也来搭把手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几块炭确实湿透了，能不能换几块？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就这么点从商队手里换来的炭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......木头还有吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"底下用掰断的木头隔开湿气，把细枝条斜靠在炉边烧。只要看情况加柴......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是从哪里学会的这些......战场上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是佣兵吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，谢谢你帮本尼生炉子，不过......你该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......什么都还没说呢，里昂先生......我不明白......您为何这么抗拒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您......能不能至少让我明白？就这样把我打发走，我是不会死心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......我四岁就被亲妈抛弃在这里，是这座矿厂的矿工把我养大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我参军时一门心思学爆破技术，就是为了以后能在矿上出力。退伍后立刻就回到了这里，成为矿上的工程师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达维镇下面的矿道，上面的厂房，就连我们前几天抢修的那座动力炉，都是我参与翻新和扩建的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿工们当年的生活......一定比现在强得多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是当年你跟我说达维镇会变成现在这样，我会认为你在骂我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是......世事难料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"后来，我收养了工友的孩子，本尼......和他的哥哥卡尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再后来......矿厂越来越不景气，我只能不计代价，把股份抓在自己手里。我不能放任那群混蛋股东把我一生的心血拆了去卖废铁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是矿厂无论如何都没法保住——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别说了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，里昂先生，如果您再这么硬撑下去，银行真的可以强制您用股份抵债！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从我家出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生，就算您把我赶走，您一样还是要面对的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，本尼，你先出去，去海伦娜阿姨那住一晚上，我和杰西卡谈完事情就去找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，不能让本尼走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你连我儿子都要管？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，好了！别说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天......银行雇来的混混找上了本尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，是真的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着本尼被烟熏得炭黑的脸，里昂心里一紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你为什么不和我说呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你说了......你又能做什么呢？去银行大闹一通吗？这又解决得了什么问题呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚刚还态度强硬的男人看见孩子离开后，瞬间佝偻了脊背蹲在炉边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他拾起火钳，小心翼翼地捅了捅炉里的木柴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即便火已经烧得很旺，一股黑烟还是从炉里窜出来，熏得他连连咳嗽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是卖了矿厂的股份，我还能剩什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......不会给本尼留下债务，房子也不会被收走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先是卡尔，卡尔走了之后是本尼......自从借下这么多外债，每天我都是在外从早忙到晚，家里的事情一直就是他们在操持......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炉子是他们生，账要他们理，差点......本尼还被人绑架......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到头来，我是账也还不上，想保护的人也没保护得了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是混蛋啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"里昂狠狠用火钳敲在火炉上，铁质的火钳竟也擦出几星火花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我对银行那群畜生低头，比杀了我都难受......一想到他们还敢绑架本尼，我恨不得把银行整个炸上天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说，卖了矿厂的股份......我还能给本尼留下一套房子，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了说服我，把我家的炉子浇成这个样子，咳咳......你也真是煞费苦心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浇......我没有做那样的事啊......那未免也有些太过分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，不是你，还能有谁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛？你来干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伍德洛不答话，只是慢悠悠地走进房间，走到炉边，放下一个看起来很重的纸箱子。\n里昂走过去，看到箱子里是码得乱七八糟的木炭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当是赔罪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放松点，里昂先生，你的鞋尖都快要把地毯蹭破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这地方和放松这个词压根扯不上关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有质押文件和转让合同我都准备好了，银行应该无话可说的。当然......本尼他也帮了很多忙。过程不会很长，一切都会解决的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生......您要喝点水吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我能站在这里就说明我做好了所有心理准备，要和它们告别了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，让我一个人待一会儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既然能单枪匹马从那些吸血的股东手里把它们签下来，就能单独一人和它们默默作别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西尔维娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样的，我偷偷看了一眼你们呈交的文件......里昂先生的债务偿还并不在我的业务范围内，可我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的参考数据有些问题......对股份的估价过高了，最后还有些漏洞填补不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还差好多......您能把里昂先生叫过来吗，我不太敢去找他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我们谁都别去叫他。我偷偷签张支票给你，你能帮我保密吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次性......这么多？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么多不多的，救急要紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可里昂先生知道的话......他自尊心那么强......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不说，我不说，没人会知道的......拜托了，西尔维娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我能再看看你们的单据吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有复印件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也够了......嗯......这些都还有调整的余地......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有税单......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，这些都是原本可以退税的项目......三十块、七十五块......这里还有笔大的，足足有四百块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加起来总共一千三百二十九，虽然和你要补的钱相比只是零头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么随便翻了翻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......也还好吧，那、那我直接去汇报了，就说你们......你们提交了新的申请......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于，里昂先生的问题算是解决了......可地块上还有这么多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我得尽快了，要赶在巴伦基地到来之前才来得及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能帮一个是一个......吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"经理，那个里昂·特雷门的事件结了。他终于愿意把股份卖掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这老家伙，足足拖了我们好几年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他卖股份的时候相当不客气，骂得相当难听，说我们是绑匪什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也就嘴上骂一骂了，还能怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那您看，我们下一步要不要直接把他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不着急。我听说有人帮他垫了笔钱，他现在确实不负债。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过他把股份这么一卖，矿厂附近还有的是人等着我们去处理呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
